# KIET Campus Talent & Career Development Platform
> **Mission:** Shifting campus hiring from self-claimed resumes to **verifiable proof of work**, continuous peer motivation, and automated placement operations for **KIET Group of Institutions** (~7,000 students).

---

## 📌 Executive Overview

Most campus talent systems fail because they either act as passive application repositories (e.g., Superset) or generic social networks (e.g., LinkedIn) with zero institutional verification. 

This platform bridges that gap by providing an end-to-end institutional talent ecosystem:
* **For Students:** 1st-year to 4th-year growth ladders, automated GitHub/LeetCode sync, peer benchmark feeds, and verified credentials.
* **For Faculty:** Low-overhead project rooms with zero conversational clutter and 1-click lab evaluations.
* **For Placement Cell (TPO):** Policy-enforced hiring drives (1-student 1-job rules), anti-fraud mark verification, and instant talent extraction for recruiters.
* **For Deans & Leadership:** Real-time visibility into department skill distributions, verified coding metrics, and startup recruiter talent pipelines.

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Backend Core** | Node.js • Express | High-performance modular monolith architecture |
| **Database & ORM** | PostgreSQL • Prisma | Strongly-typed relational data models & relational integrity |
| **In-Memory Cache & Queues**| Redis • BullMQ | Atomic rate limiting, nightly coding sync, and delayed auto-submit exam workers |
| **Storage & Media** | AWS S3 / Cloudflare R2 | Direct browser presigned uploads for marksheet PDFs and project media |
| **AI Microservice** | Python • FastAPI | AST code inspection, project plagiarism analysis, and skill scoring *(Phase 5)* |
| **DevOps & Infra** | Docker • AWS • GitHub Actions | Containerized services, CI/CD pipeline, and staged deployment |

---

## 🏗️ Core Architectural Modules

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      KIET CAMPUS PLATFORM ARCHITECTURE                 │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [ Campus Feed ]     [ Student Profile ]     [ Class Project Rooms ]   │
│  • 3 Posts/Day       • Nightly Sync          • Zero-Text Guard         │
│  • Cursor Paginated  • Academics Audit       • 1-Click Faculty Review  │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [ Learning Engine ] [ Exams & Mock Tests ]  [ Alumni Directory ]      │
│  • 3-Phase Gatekeep  • Server Timers         • Package Privacy         │
│  • Auto-Certificates • Anti-Cheating Telemetry• Multi-Filter Search     │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [ Superset ATS ]    [ Helper Support ]      [ Talent Extraction ]     │
│  • Eligibility Rules • Load-Balanced Tickets • 1-Click Startup Export  │
│  • Policy Engine     • Threaded Discussions  • Pre-Vetted Candidates   │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

1. **[Student Profile System](plan/student_profile_architecture.md):** Admin-locked college meta (`@kiet.edu`), nightly BullMQ sync for GitHub and LeetCode activity charts, self-declared SGPA/CGPA with S3 presigned marksheets, and a 1-click fraud audit & fine mechanism.
2. **[Campus Placement Engine (Superset-Grade ATS)](plan/superset_placement_engine.md):** 3-party stakeholder workflow (Student, TPO, Recruiter), dynamic JSONB eligibility criteria, multi-round selection pipelines, and institutional offer policies (1-Student 1-Job rule, Dream Company upgrade rules).
3. **[Campus Feed Engine](plan/campus_feed_architecture.md):** Social motivation hub featuring Redis atomic 3-posts-per-day rate limits with rollback mechanics and high-throughput cursor pagination.
4. **[3-Phase Learning & Certification Engine](plan/learning_and_certification_engine.md):** Beginner $\rightarrow$ Intermediate $\rightarrow$ Advance sequential progression gatekeeping with auto-minted cryptographic certificates.
5. **[Class Project Rooms](plan/class_project_rooms_architecture.md):** Noise-free lab submission drop box enforcing a zero-text policy (screenshots + repository link only) and 1-click teacher grading.
6. **[Alumni Directory & Network](plan/alumni_directory_architecture.md):** Automated final-year placement graduation transition, package privacy toggles (`isPackagePublic`), and multi-dimensional company filters.
7. **[Exams & Mock Tests Engine](plan/exam_and_mock_test_engine.md):** Server-enforced test windows, BullMQ delayed auto-submit workers, and anti-cheating telemetry (disqualification after 3 tab switches).
8. **[Helper & Mentor Support Engine](plan/helper_mentor_support_engine.md):** Embedded in-course testing co-located with load-balanced doubt ticket queues for peer mentors and TAs.

